<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 414)</h2>
<p><b>Camera gates by their real names.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The gate catalog now carries real sensor formats — LF Open Gate, ALEXA 35 Open Gate, 3.4K Open Gate, 65 Open Gate and friends — in the Measure From menu and in Auto-Detect.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
