<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 412)</h2>
<p><b>Aspect guides that know where the picture really is.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>When a shot's picture sits inside a larger container (an open-gate original in a 16:9 QuickTime), guides can measure the true image — Aspect Guides → Measure From, or Auto-Detect Gate. The gate draws as a dashed outline and the setting stays with the clip.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
